OL,3,GNEWSACat brings dead extremely rare
OL,4,Asongbird into home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA songbird described as a "national
OL,7,Frarity" has been found dead after it
OL,8,Fwas caught by a cat.
OL,10,FA woman said her "heart sank" after her
OL,11,Fcat brought the dead Siberian
OL,12,Frubythroat - a species related to the
OL,13,FEuropean robin - into her home in
OL,14,FBrampton, Cumbria, on Sunday.
OL,16,FChris Hind, Cumbria's county recorder
OL,17,Ffor birds, said there had only been 17
OL,18,Faccepted records of Siberian rubythroat
OL,19,Fin Britain between 1975 and 2022 due to
OL,20,Fit being a "very secretive" bird,
OL,21,Fmaking this "an extraordinary
OL,22,Fscenario".
